        "360505"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0c39310d892b6d554f23273",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得干劲上升效果<color=#ff911c>3次</color>后，将进入为期3回合的<color=#ff911c>超级绝佳</color>状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8c683868692f0804773bac18733ec639fd62f70937b8d9f87d4b65a736fd0c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a806669b6c02d3fd80ee3af0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入超级绝佳时，不会再发生偏头痛",
      "source_fingerprint": "709666c0fabe0afccbfb0bd5ec0a297243e47abab41c15285ef4946b268e0cb3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904602"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b47cca5ab22d55ab5bd8337",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在超级绝佳状态下，<color=#ff911c>干劲</color>不会<color=#ff911c>下降</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b0b6d267b25912e406cf7fb0bd83c0464ad9aaa82ce1fc9441602ce491ceafe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904603"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:827ee60ee8843676819b7974",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在超级绝佳状态下，由干劲效果提升的训练效果将提升<color=#ff911c>55%</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "635a30ee180234e2354f212f454cb45c0fdc3e2a15021f68275dcdb2acd5c79d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904604"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f352eed9180a2af2d6f0b46",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在超级绝佳状态下获得干劲上升效果时，最多可延长<color=#ff911c>1回合</color>效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "df790cb257249976bc7ff84bc77773e7214248fc890eb4bddf4fab67d690f818",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904605"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3b563453e467fac6f69de4e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超级绝佳结束时，干劲将变为绝佳",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e6bf81069a814e7035617ea96555318527b601e6f16b88f1b9a4e29853d8ec7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904606"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3b58004f04a32d2e558f1a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成功进行<color=#ff911c>4次</color>训练后，将进入<color=#ff911c>挑战领域</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "95da354ffdc913423480d5478136840633ddab887b2565ba51617f434f550d48",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f6fbd6fdd2ecd50d97e9ea3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在挑战领域中，不会获得状态「懒散性格」",
      "source_fingerprint": "cad74fae5be318d37ab242b976ca75f1097c44fa391ca6b2f8aae40dc68d6f9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904702"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7616dc552af27b438224232",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在挑战领域中，<color=#ff911c>训练不会失败</color>，\\n训练效果提升<color=#ff911c>+30%</color>，体力消耗降低<color=#ff911c>50%</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "db28778c099fd1e50315a63b12a26f1912fce5498960de0ed000cf4d8ffebb55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904703"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca5e874b39ef1e512f52b6df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行训练时，会根据<color=#ff911c>持续回合数和剩余体力</color>\\n判断是否继续挑战领域，基于变化的结束率决定。\\n若无法继续，挑战领域将结束。\\n此外，<color=#ff911c>达到一定回合</color>时也会结束",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e5139e85a04b169975e61bf0af139ac4ed4d5aa8b2112b18765473d7243e4af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904704"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ad23e5993691e63a9841f5e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行<color=#ff911c>休息或外出</color>会结束挑战领域",
      "source_fingerprint": "e674fae06a83127115fe48fd04905574b4f28fb44429d62058516053d5da924c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904705"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3297ea2a2ad068312f558ac1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "挑战领域结束时，根据持续回合数获得相应的<color=#ff911c>数值</color>，\\n获得的数值会因达成的结束条件而变化",
      "source_fingerprint": "01550e2f4e08f1dbc4747d6967e5bd133aba3b589c62bcee67761cecdc249da1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904706"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:290de30602991404c9e36358",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "具有擅长训练的<color=#ff911c>训练合作伙伴</color>将新加入",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e30b884dc3fe32cf8154371fb5487aafdd0afbb2ea1e5a5b8ed1482a451f188",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904801"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:796640660dfcce358c043524",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "具有擅长训练的马娘将获得<color=#ff911c>亲友条</color>和<color=#ff911c>亲友Lv</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "0306291159ddf6c55eeed303fb6a8b275a05d382a0244c1cd5addffd2b9a14bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904802"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a9f30e399d0ed3ee176e1b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当亲友条达到<color=#ff911c>MAX</color>时，将被安排到擅长训练中",
      "source_fingerprint": "92cbd092ce62a99bdb132759f2de819517e9b43f2c0c2c10550b9df1c203a4d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904803"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0fc66c6b99d10a75f52edc3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当亲友条达到<color=#ff911c>MAX</color>时，合作伙伴将会触发<color=#ff911c>友情训练</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9bd25118f2906a4c81d7ad535ae1616061135afd35bff8b1e31d71631344d3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385",
        "904804"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2616cd16909ce246ea12d29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "亲友条会在训练和事件中获得牵绊条时提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "15c9e8dba1d8c354f771866ab79842f1701948412b20a0484604d100a0190179",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
